/* Goodies customer app entry. Mount inside the main Wantiss app:
     <GoodiesApp onExit={() => navigation.goBack()} />
   Navigation is an internal stack that mirrors v24 (S.stack). Native back (Android) and left-edge swipe (iOS and Android) both call navBack(). */

/* Build Your Own engine. Port of the v24 builder logic (bClean, bBreak, bCheck, bLine, lineBad, drafts, actions).
   Differences from v24, all deliberate:
   - ingredients reference Admin library asset IDs (`assetId`) instead of v24's name-matching (`phKey`);
   - builders are configured in the Vendor Dashboard, so the seller screens are gone from this file;
   - an ingredient can also carry a per-item limit (`max`), chosen by the vendor.
   Builder config is stored under 'goodies-byo-v4', the same key the Vendor Dashboard writes in demo mode. */

/* Pizza artwork. Shapes, gradients and the procedural generators are copied from Goodies v24.
   v24 also used SVG filters (roughen, blur, noise). react-native-svg cannot run them, so they are left out: the look is slightly cleaner than the web version.
   This drawn pizza is TEMPORARY. When the Admin library holds top-down pizza layers, those are shown instead (see BuilderStage). */

/* Starter templates. Copied from Goodies v24 (tplPizza, tplBurger, tplCustom). Items now reference admin library asset IDs instead of v24's name-matching.
   Bun items reference a pair base (burger.bun_sesame -> _top and _bottom). Sauce items reference a base (burger.sauce_ketchup -> layer, icon, cup).
   PROPOSED contract: assetId values must exist in the Wantiss Admin builder library. */

/* Goodies store/content is a circular module pair. Hermes can expose the imported binding before
   the store module has finished initializing. Register these hooks after the current module graph
   has finished evaluating so contentHooks is guaranteed to be initialized. */

/* Interface string drafts: English -> fr, ht, es, zh-Hans.
   ALL ARE MACHINE DRAFTS. They are shown in the demo only (cfg.showMachineDrafts) and must be human reviewed before production.
   Haitian Creole in particular needs a native reviewer. Lookup is by exact English text, see ts() in i18n/index.ts. */

/* Goodies tools for the Vendor Dashboard (Business Space).
   Moves the seller-side screens out of the Goodies customer app (v24 `seller` and `sellerEdit`) and adds store setup and ingredient requests.
   Store setup, products, builder configurations and publishing go through Supabase. Existing builder drafts are imported from AsyncStorage once; ingredient requests, their photos and the photo rules go through Supabase. */

/* Starter templates. Copied from Goodies v24 (tplPizza, tplBurger, tplCustom). Items now reference admin library asset IDs instead of v24's name-matching.
   Bun items reference a pair base (burger.bun_sesame -> _top and _bottom). Sauce items reference a base (burger.sauce_ketchup -> layer, icon, cup).
   PROPOSED contract: assetId values must exist in the Wantiss Admin builder library. */

